Package: golang-github-rmahique-multilang-lib-dev
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Reusable multi-language string storage library (Go source)
 Provides RetrieveData, InsertData, and DBConnector for storing and
 retrieving translated strings, keyed by string_id + BCP 47 language_id,
 against SQLite, PostgreSQL, or MySQL/MariaDB.
 .
 Ships as Go source under the GOPATH-style /usr/share/gocode/src/ tree,
 per Debian's Go packaging policy -- there is no compiled artifact here;
 consumers `go build`/`go get` against the installed import path. Actual
 database driver dependencies (github.com/lib/pq, github.com/go-sql-
 driver/mysql, modernc.org/sqlite) are resolved by the consuming module's
 own go.mod, not by this package.
